<title>FRANCE: Danone sets 1996 net div to 17 ffr/share.</title>
<headline>Danone sets 1996 net div to 17 ffr/share.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French food group Danone said in a statement on Monday it planned to pay a net dividend of 17 francs per share for 1996.</p>
<p>This compares with a net dividend of 16 francs per share for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
